Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set FontSize 15
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 15
Hide
Type "export XDG_CACHE_HOME=/vhs/assets/tapes/.cache PS1='$ ' && cd /vhs/assets/tapes" Enter
Type "echo x | ./lazyregex-linux -f python -p a" Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 300ms
